SUMMARY:Clawtoberfest
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, September 26 | Free | Family-Friendly\nRaise a stein and celebrate fall at Highland Brewing’s Annual Clawtoberfest! Join us for an afternoon filled with Oktoberfest-inspired fun\, delicious food\, German beer\, lively games\, and unforgettable live music in the Meadow. \nSchedule \n11am – Taproom & Meadow Bars Open\n1-4pm – Live Traditional Music with Lagerhosen & Face Painting for Kids\n5-8pm – Live Music with Wilson Springs Hotel \nFood Vendors  \n11am: Trucking Delicious\n12pm: Bullheded Peanut Co.\n12pm: Bigfoot-Longs\n12pm: The Outpost\n1pm: Frios Pops\n1pm: Garage Barbecue\n2pm: Charley King’s Jamaican \nEnjoy pours of Highland’s seasonal Clawhammer Oktoberfest\, knowing each pint supports a great cause. Through Highland Brewing’s longtime Thirst for Good partnership with Southern Appalachian Highlands Conservancy (SAHC)\, $1 from every pour of Clawhammer Oktoberfest will be donated to local land and water conservation efforts across the Southern Appalachians. \nHighland and SAHC have partnered for more than a decade\, making it Highland’s longest-standing community partnership. Together\, they’ve helped connect friends and fans to the mountains and waterways of our region through seasonal releases\, conservation initiatives\, and community hikes celebrating the places SAHC works to protect. 🍂🍻
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/clawtoberfest/
LOCATION:Meadow at Highland Brewing Co.\, 12 Old Charlotte Highway\, Suite 200\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Public Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/IMG_9061-1-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Highland Brewing
